          description: "A body text typography element for rendering paragraphs, inline text, and labels with design-system font styles.\n\nUse the as prop to control the HTML element (span by default, also p, li, label, etc.). Use size (x-small to large) and weight (default, strong, x-strong) to set typography. Use color for semantic text colors. Use boxColor when the text appears inside a colored container and needs a contextual color. Use Heading for h1\u2013h6 heading elements.\n\nExposed variant properties:\nsize: x-small, small, medium, large\nweight: default, strong, x-strong\nboxColor: positive\n\nText properties edit the exposed content. Icon properties swap the native icon; Show properties control its visibility.\n\nCoverage: supported. \n\nSource: https://github.com/Frontify/fondue/tree/ebcc9b8579a7f862f43a2732f5a5b9c3105e6796/packages/components/src/components/Text/Text.tsx"
