          description: "A visual separator between content sections, either horizontal or vertical. Use to establish a clear visual hierarchy in the UI. They should be subtle and not overpower the content they are meant to organize.\n\nUse direction='vertical' for inline dividers between horizontal elements. Set decorative=true when the divider is purely visual and should be hidden from screen readers. Use as='li' when the divider appears inside a list. The padding prop controls spacing around the line, not the line thickness.\n\nExposed variant properties:\ndirection: vertical\nvariant: solid\npadding: none, small, medium, large\ncolor: weak, default, strong\n\nText properties edit the exposed content. Icon properties swap the native icon; Show properties control its visibility.\n\nCoverage: supported. \n\nSource: https://github.com/Frontify/fondue/tree/ebcc9b8579a7f862f43a2732f5a5b9c3105e6796/packages/components/src/components/Divider/Divider.tsx"
