          description: "A horizontal progress bar for showing determinate or indeterminate loading progress. Use for file uploads, multi-step processes, or any operation with measurable progress.\n\nEither aria-label or aria-labelledby is required for accessibility. Pass a numeric value for determinate progress (0 to max, default max=100). Omit value or pass null for indeterminate (animated) state. Use variant to communicate success or failure state. Use LoadingCircle when this layout pattern is not suitable.\n\nExposed variant properties:\nvariant: positive\nrounded: false\nsize: small, medium, large, x-large\nvalue: 0, 25, 50, 75, 100, indeterminate\n\nText properties edit the exposed content. Icon properties swap the native icon; Show properties control its visibility.\n\nCoverage: partial. All finite size/intent/rounding axes covered. Numeric value/max are continuous; native component offers 0/25/50/75/100 sample proportions and an indeterminate 40% animation pose. Resize indicator for other values.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Frontify/fondue/tree/ebcc9b8579a7f862f43a2732f5a5b9c3105e6796/packages/components/src/components/LoadingBar/LoadingBar.tsx"
