          purpose: "A form label that associates visible text with an input element for accessibility. Always use alongside form inputs like TextInput, Checkbox, Select, and Switch.",
          usage: "Always provide htmlFor matching the input's id, or use id on the Label with aria-labelledby on the input. Use required prop to show an asterisk indicator. Use variant='strong' for emphasized labels. The Label automatically becomes visually disabled when its associated input is disabled \u2014 use data-label-ignore-disabled='true' on sibling containers (like action button groups) to prevent them from affecting the label state.",
