          usage: "All props (direction, gap, align, justify, wrap, spacing) support responsive objects with breakpoint keys (base, xs, sm, md, lg, xl, 2xl). Gap accepts design token numbers or pixel strings. Use as='span' for inline-flex contexts. Use Grid when you need two-dimensional column/row layouts.",
