          description: "A small indicator used to highlight status, count, or contextual information. Use to convey concise data at a glance, and enhancing clarity without overwhelming the interface.\n\nUse variant to control color semantics (default, positive, highlight, warning, negative). Use emphasis='weak' for a subtler appearance. Provide a status prop (string color or RgbaColor object) to show a colored dot. Provide onDismiss to show a dismiss button. Use Tag instead if the label needs to be removable or interactive in a form context.\n\nExposed variant properties:\nvariant: default, positive, highlight\nemphasis: strong, weak\nsize: default, small\nstate: default, hover, disabled\n\nText properties edit the exposed content. Icon properties swap the native icon; Show properties control its visibility.\n\nCoverage: partial. Status dot and dismiss are independently hideable native properties. Arbitrary custom status colors remain editable fill overrides. Forced-colors media rendering remains in CSS. Reviewed profile contract: all enum values have native examples, but the full cross-product is not imported. Every variant/emphasis/state at default size; every variant/emphasis at small/default state. Reviewed profile contract: all enum values have native examples, but the full cross-product is not imported. Every variant/emphasis/state at default size; every variant/emphasis at small/default state.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Frontify/fondue/tree/ebcc9b8579a7f862f43a2732f5a5b9c3105e6796/packages/components/src/components/Badge/Badge.metadata.json"
