          purpose: "A boolean toggle for enabling or disabling a setting. Use when toggling takes immediate effect without a form submission.",
          usage: "Always pair with a Label for accessibility \u2014 connect via id/htmlFor or use aria-labelledby. The Switch has no hugWidth prop; control layout using flex containers (use flex + gap for compact, flex + justify-between for full-width label-switch rows). Use Checkbox instead when the toggle is part of a form submitted later.",
