          usage: "Provide onDismiss to show a dismiss (\xD7) button. Provide onAddClick to show an add (+) button. Use Tag.SecondaryContent for additional metadata displayed within the tag (can appear before or after main content). Use Tag.HoverContent to replace the tag's content with alternative content on hover.",
