          description: "A range input for selecting a numerical value or range between a minimum and maximum.\n\nValue is an array of numbers \u2014 use a single-element array for a single thumb, or two elements for a range slider. Use defaultValue for uncontrolled or value + onChange for controlled. onChange fires during drag; onCommit fires only when the user releases. Use minStepsBetweenThumbs to enforce a minimum gap in range sliders. Always provide aria-label or aria-labelledby for accessibility.\n\nExposed variant properties:\nvalue: 0, 25, 50\nrange: single, range\nstate: default, hover, active, focus, disabled\n\nText properties edit the exposed content. Icon properties swap the native icon; Show properties control its visibility.\n\nCoverage: supported. Values are sample stops within the source continuous range. Drag thumb positions and resize filled track for arbitrary values; min/max/step remain runtime constraints. Active pointer thumb shadow outline requires native visual QA.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Frontify/fondue/tree/ebcc9b8579a7f862f43a2732f5a5b9c3105e6796/packages/components/src/components/Slider/Slider.metadata.json"
