          usage: "Value is an array of numbers \u2014 use a single-element array for a single thumb, or two elements for a range slider. Use defaultValue for uncontrolled or value + onChange for controlled. onChange fires during drag; onCommit fires only when the user releases. Use minStepsBetweenThumbs to enforce a minimum gap in range sliders. Always provide aria-label or aria-labelledby for accessibility.",
