          description: "A combined primary action button with a secondary dropdown menu. Use when a main action has several related secondary options.\n\nCompose as SplitButton.Root > SplitButton.Content + SplitButton.Action. Place a Dropdown.Root inside SplitButton.Action with a SplitButton.ActionButton as the Dropdown.Trigger (use asChild). The emphasis and size on SplitButton.Root apply to both sections. Always provide aria-label on SplitButton.ActionButton describing what the secondary options are.\n\nExposed variant properties:\nemphasis: weak\nsize: small, medium, large\nstate: default, hover, active, focus, disabled\nrotateIcon: false, true\n\nText properties edit the exposed content. Icon properties swap the native icon; Show properties control its visibility.\n\nCoverage: supported. Content and menu trigger are separate native controls; dropdown menu composition is provided by Dropdown assets.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Frontify/fondue/tree/ebcc9b8579a7f862f43a2732f5a5b9c3105e6796/packages/components/src/components/SplitButton/SplitButton.metadata.json"
