        documentation: {
          purpose: "A color selection panel with gradient canvas and hex/RGBA value inputs. Use when users need to pick or enter an exact color value.",
          usage: "The picker panel (ColorPicker.Root with ColorPicker.Gradient and/or ColorPicker.Values) does not include its own popover \u2014 wrap it in a Flyout for the standard trigger-and-panel pattern. Use ColorPicker.Input as the Flyout trigger to display the selected color. Colors are represented as RgbaColor objects ({ red, green, blue, alpha, name? }). Use currentFormat and onFormatChange to control HEX vs RGBA display.",
          properties: "currentFormat: HEX, RGBA",
          related: [],
          origin: "released-metadata",
          metadataSource: "packages/components/src/components/ColorPicker/ColorPicker.metadata.json",
          links: [
            {
              uri: "https://github.com/Frontify/fondue/tree/ebcc9b8579a7f862f43a2732f5a5b9c3105e6796/packages/components/src/components/ColorPicker/ColorPicker.tsx"
            },
            {
              uri: "https://fondue.frontify.com/"
            }
          ],
          description: "A color selection panel with gradient canvas and hex/RGBA value inputs. Use when users need to pick or enter an exact color value.\n\nThe picker panel (ColorPicker.Root with ColorPicker.Gradient and/or ColorPicker.Values) does not include its own popover \u2014 wrap it in a Flyout for the standard trigger-and-panel pattern. Use ColorPicker.Input as the Flyout trigger to display the selected color. Colors are represented as RgbaColor objects ({ red, green, blue, alpha, name? }). Use currentFormat and onFormatChange to control HEX vs RGBA display.\n\nExposed variant properties:\ncurrentFormat: HEX, RGBA\n\nText properties edit the exposed content. Icon properties swap the native icon; Show properties control its visibility.\n\nCoverage: partial. react-colorful dependency default geometry is represented as a red-color specimen; dynamic color-coordinate conversion and checkerboard alpha remain partial. Responsive value-input wrap below312px is not represented by these desktop compositions. Native static definitions do not implement browser event handlers, focus management or accessibility semantics. Source styling and finite states are encoded here; visual parity still requires Figma runtime review.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Frontify/fondue/tree/ebcc9b8579a7f862f43a2732f5a5b9c3105e6796/packages/components/src/components/ColorPicker/ColorPicker.tsx"
        }
